  "summary": "Изменены ровно два файла моей карточки. Публикую.\n\n```json\n{\"version\":1,\"taskId\":\"9f3b1b9c-b600-47d6-a4bf-302656fda9b9\",\"commandId\":\"publish-1\",\"operation\":\"publish\",\"headSha\":\"e0a720a0b8185824d35e09937c677a9ed3d5752e\",\"message\":\"fix(runtime): drive sliding walls, doors and pendulums from the hole clock\\n\\nHoleRuntime treated only spinner/windmill/gate/platform as moving, so sliding-wall,\\ndoor and pendulum descriptors got fixed bodies and stood still. isMoving now covers\\nevery MovingObstacle type via an exhaustive record, and update() is built on the\\npure helpers: rotationAngle() from obstacles/rotating for rotate and swing motion\\n(pendulums carry their body along the arc around the pivot) and sampleMover() from\\nobstacles/movers for translate motion, which brings loop, once and end pauses.\\nAdds moverPose() to read a kinematic pose back and a test covering the three types.\"}\n```\n\nЖду результат worker.\n\n",
